Hon.E.N.RHOD'ES (Minister of Finance): I have not had an opportunity to look into this, but I think, Mr. Speaker, upon examination you will find that this motion covers a subject which has already been dealt with by way of an amendment moved by the hon. member far Winnipeg North Centre (Mr. Woodsworth) to the address in reply to the speech from the throne. Having been debated once during the session, under the rules the subject may not be debated again.

